				<p>One of the most important components on your air compressor is the couplings and plugs that attach an accessory or hose to the machine.</p>
				<p>By learning the difference between the <a href="@Url.Action("CouplersAndFittings", "Compressor")">styles of fittings available</a>, you can figure out what type will work best with your compressor, and will also ensure that the correct styles are purchased.</p>
			</li>
